# General API guidelines

Rules to design the API

- Use Pydantic models for request and response schemas
- Always take care about rate limiting
- Follow the Open API specifications (https://spec.openapis.org/oas/latest.html#openapi-specification)
- Always version the API
- Follow best practices of API designs (error handling, rate limit, specs, headers, etc)
